# What each scene of each bundled set costs the GPU per frame (ms), to keep the demos smooth:
# at 60 fps a frame has 16.7 ms. Run from the repo root:
#   cargo run --release -- --script scripts/sets-cost.tripslop
# Every scene is given two seconds to compile its shaders and fill its feedback first.

open public-access
quantize off
at 2s  print frame-ms
at 2s  launch-scene 2
at 4s  print frame-ms
at 4s  launch-scene 3
at 6s  print frame-ms
at 6s  launch-scene 4
at 8s  print frame-ms

at 8s  open patch-bay
quantize off
at 10s print frame-ms
at 10s launch-scene 2
at 12s print frame-ms
at 12s launch-scene 3
at 14s print frame-ms
at 14s launch-scene 4
at 16s print frame-ms

at 16s open deep-field
quantize off
at 18s print frame-ms
at 18s launch-scene 2
at 20s print frame-ms
at 20s launch-scene 3
at 22s print frame-ms
at 22s launch-scene 4
at 24s print frame-ms

at 24s open warehouse
quantize off
at 26s print frame-ms
at 26s launch-scene 2
at 28s print frame-ms
at 28s launch-scene 3
at 30s print frame-ms
at 30s launch-scene 4
at 32s print frame-ms

at 32s open showroom
quantize off
at 34s print frame-ms
at 34s launch-scene 2
at 36s print frame-ms
at 36s launch-scene 3
at 38s print frame-ms
at 38s launch-scene 4
at 40s print frame-ms

at 40s open lava-lamp
quantize off
at 42s print frame-ms
at 42s launch-scene 2
at 44s print frame-ms
at 44s launch-scene 3
at 46s print frame-ms
at 46s launch-scene 4
at 48s print frame-ms
quit
